{{!
  cargo-about's template for the Rust part of THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt (ADR 0031 RL3, T227).
  Filled by tools/third-party-notices.ps1, which also replaces each "#copyright <name> <version>"
  line with that package's copyright line, or removes it. Plain text: every field is written with
  triple braces so that <, > and & are not escaped. One entry per licence text (identical texts
  once); the packages that use it, then the text.
}}
